  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">chicken ramen stir fry is a quick, flavor-packed dish that turns simple noodles and tender chicken into an ultra-satisfying weeknight meal. Juicy chicken bites toss with crisp veggies like bell peppers, broccoli, and carrots, then get coated in a savory-sweet sauce made with soy, garlic, and ginger. The ramen noodles drink up every drop so each bite is chewy, saucy, and hearty. Ready in under 30 minutes, chicken ramen stir fry is perfect for busy nights when you want something homemade, colorful, and full of flavor.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-chicken-ramen-stir-fry\">Why You’ll Love This CHICKEN RAMEN STIR FRY</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-chicken-ramen-stir-fry\">How to Make CHICKEN RAMEN STIR FRY</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-chicken-ramen-stir-fry\">Pro Tips for Making CHICKEN RAMEN STIR FRY</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-chicken-ramen-stir-fry\">How to Serve this CHICKEN RAMEN STIR FRY</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-chicken-ramen-stir-fry\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This CHICKEN RAMEN STIR FRY</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quick and easy to whip up on busy nights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Deliciously satisfying with tender chicken and fresh veggies.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite toppings and sauces.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>One-pan meal for easy cleanup and minimal fuss.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-4948\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"4948\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe